msgstr "렌더 모드"

#: widgets/AoT_facility.py:476
msgid ""
"Default: semi-transparent cover. Solid: opaque, lower overdraw. Wireframe: "
"outlines only. Performance: simplified shading + reduced resolution for "
"mobile."
msgstr ""
"기본: 반투명 커버. 단색: 불투명, 오버드로 감소. 와이어프레임: 외곽선만. 성능: 모바일용 간소화 셰이딩 + 해상도 축소."

#: widgets/AoT_facility.py:486
msgid "Sensor Labels"
msgstr "센서 레이블"

#: widgets/AoT_facility.py:492
msgid "Show Sensor Labels"
msgstr "센서 레이블 표시"

#: widgets/AoT_facility.py:493
msgid ""
"Display realtime measurement values next to each sensor in the 3D scene."
msgstr "3D 장면에서 각 센서 옆에 실시간 측정값을 표시합니다."

#: widgets/AoT_facility.py:499 widgets/AoT_map.py:913
